Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一个奶酪聊天机器人，跑在你的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is a cheese chatbot, running on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你问它 Tolminc 奶酪是怎么做的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You ask it how Tolminc cheese is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:09.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案出来了，附带 10 段书里的原文作为参考来源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An answer appears, with ten book passages as references.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这一个回答背后，你的浏览器发起了三次调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Behind that one answer, your browser makes three calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中两次打到 port 9000 上的一个 Python 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two go to a Python server on port 9000,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:19.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次打到 port 8000 上的一个数据库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and one goes to a database on port 8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:23.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这两个服务器调用的背后，都是 Google 在干重活\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Behind both server calls, Google does the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:25.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，谁来确认真的是你？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So who checks that it is really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:29.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，网页怎么找到 container 里的数据库？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And how does a web page find a database inside a container?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:32.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个应用里藏着三个小谜题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three small riddles hide in this app.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:37.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 -p 3200:3000 里有两个数字，为什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The flag -p 3200:3000 has two numbers; why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有这里的 localhost:9000，指的是哪台机器？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And localhost:9000: which machine is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:45.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 llm-rag-chromadb 只是一个名字，它的地址在哪儿？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And llm-rag-chromadb is only a name; where is its address?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个谜题今天都会揭晓答案\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each one gets its answer today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:52.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后真正的问题来了：既然谁都能来敲门，谁才能进来？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the real question arrives: once anything can knock, who is allowed in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:57.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跟着做需要你 clone 的 cheese-app-v0、Docker Desktop\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To follow along you need your clone of cheese-app-v0, Docker Desktop,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:01:00.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a Google Cloud project with billing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:04.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一讲会真的发起付费的 Vertex AI 调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This lecture makes real, paid calls to Vertex AI;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:09.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一处都有金色标签标出，视频最后会把一切都关掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a gold tag marks each one, and the video ends by shutting everything down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:15.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,左上角的进度条按六个阶段跟着 README 走，从准备一直到关闭\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker in the top left follows the README in six stages, from setup to shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:18.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A yellow your-turn tag means pause and run it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:22.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a gray extra tag marks a check that is not in the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令都在学习指南里，链接在下方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command is in the study guide, linked below.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先是地图，它会陪我们走完这一讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, the map, which stays with us all lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本是一栋房子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop is one house,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.41,0:01:37.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每栋房子都有自己的回环地址 localhost，它永远指这台机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every house has its own loopback address, localhost, which always means this machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.50,0:01:41.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 在里面铺了两条私有的街道，一个网络一条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker lays two private streets inside it, one per network.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:43.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,会有三个服务站在这些街上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three services will stand on them:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:48.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,向量数据库和它的加载器、API 服务器，还有网页前端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the vector database with its loader, the API server, and the web frontend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:51.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每栋房子都会在它的 container 启动时亮起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each house lights up when its container starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.83,0:01:55.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的浏览器站在笔记本的地面上，不在任何一条街上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your browser stands on the laptop floor, outside every street.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:59.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,公共街道对面是 Google 的大楼，门口有人把守\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Across the public street sits Google's building, with a guarded door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:01.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，谁打给谁？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now, who calls whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:04.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载器打给 Google 和数据库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loader calls Google and the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 打给 Google\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The API calls Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:08.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的浏览器打给其余所有服务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your browser calls everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:13.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 API 从不和数据库说话；README 自己就是这么写的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the API never talks to the database; the README says so itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分会讲为什么浏览器要干这么多活\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 shows why the browser does so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:18.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,该动手敲了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Time to type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.10,0:02:23.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的前置条件很短：装好 Docker，再 clone 这个仓库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's prerequisites are short: have Docker installed, and clone this repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:27.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 没给地址，所以这里给出 repo 的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README gives no address, so here is the repo's address.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它 clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and clone it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 git log，可以看到这个视频用的 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git log shows the commit this video uses,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日期是 2026 年 10 月 8 日\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from October 8th, 2026;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的要是更新，细节可能不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if yours is newer, details may differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.28,0:02:43.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外列一下目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:47.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,llm-rag、api-service 和 frontend-ai-chatbot\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}shows llm-rag, api-service, and frontend-ai-chatbot:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:49.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一栋房子一个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one folder per house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:50.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One small gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:54.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个应用自己的主页上，动画演示的是一个托管版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The app's own home page animates a hosted version,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:56.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Web 服务器跑在一台云端机器上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a web server on a cloud machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那套部署的文件已经从 repo 里删掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The files for that setup were deleted from the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:04.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你跑的是本地版本，而这张地图画的正是你跑的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You are running the local version, and this map draws exactly what you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:09.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个前置条件是创建一个身份，但不是给你用的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second prerequisite creates an identity, but not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:12.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务账号就是给软件用的身份\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A service account is an identity for software.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:17.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的邮箱就像这张工牌：llm-service-account，后面是你的项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its email looks like this badge: llm-service-account@your-gcp-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:21.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码戴着它去调用 Google，不需要登录界面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Code wears it to call Google, with no login screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:24.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按量计费的公开调用用 API key\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A metered public call gets an API key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:28.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,替一个同意授权的用户办事的应用，用 OAuth\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An app acting for a consenting user gets OAuth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是用 Google 账号登录的那套流程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the Sign in with Google flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:35.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的代码在你自己的项目里调用 Vertex AI，所以它用服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our code calls Vertex AI in your own project, so it gets a service account.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:40.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,规则最后一行说，Google 之外的代码应该用身份联合\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The rule's last line says code outside Google should use federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:43.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这需要有人为你的代码担保\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That needs someone to vouch for your code,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:45.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就像 GitHub 为 GitHub Actions 里的代码担保那样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as GitHub does for code in GitHub Actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,笔记本没有人来担保，所以课程改为直接给你一个密钥文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A laptop has nobody, so the course hands you a key file instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开 IAM & Admin，再进 Service accounts\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open IAM & Admin, then Service accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:56.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,建一个，名字叫 llm-service-account\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create one named llm-service-account.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:04:00.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给它授予两个角色，也就是权限的集合：Storage Admin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Grant it two roles, bundles of permissions: Storage Admin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform User\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform User.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:09.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个角色以前叫 Vertex AI User，本质上还是同一个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second role was formerly called Vertex AI User; it is the same role underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，建一个你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and create yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关于课件，说两点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two notes on the slides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:17.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件里那个只有一个存储角色的演示账号，是下周的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slides' demo account, with one storage role, is next week's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:23.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这个应用从来不碰存储；那个角色是从微调那一讲带过来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And this app never touches storage; that role rides along from the fine-tuning lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:25.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不过两个都要授予，照 README 说的做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Grant both anyway, as the README says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:30.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的规则是最小权限，意思是只给你需要的权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's rule, least privilege, meaning only the access you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:31.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照它来会授予得更少\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}would grant less;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分还会回到这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}part 2 comes back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个账号的 KEYS 标签页添加一个密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the account's Keys tab, add a key,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:38.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,选 JSON，就会下载一个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}choose JSON, and a file downloads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:40.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，做一个你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and make yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:45.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面有你的项目、这个账号的邮箱、一个令牌地址，还有一个私钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside are your project, the account's email, a token address, and a private key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个私钥就是全部的秘密\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That private key is the whole secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它只是单一因素，属于你持有的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is one factor, something you have:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:55.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在哪儿都能用，不需要第二步，直到被删除或停用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it works anywhere, with no second step, until deleted or disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把这个文件当密码看待，绝不要当配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Treat this file like a password, never like config.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:03.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说把密钥复制到一个 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says to copy the key into a secrets folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:07.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一个？API 的脚本在第 8 行给出了答案\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which one? The API's script answers on line 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:10.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路径从你运行它的地方开始，也就是 api-service\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The path starts where you run it, in api-service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:14.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它往上爬两级，落在 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It climbs up twice and lands on the secrets folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在 repo 旁边，而不是里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}beside the repo, not inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:20.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着，一个 -v 参数把这个宿主机目录挂载到 /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then a -v flag mounts that host folder at /secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 container 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google application credentials 这个变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS variable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:28.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,告诉 Google 的库密钥在哪儿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which tells Google's library where the key is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它指向 /secrets，一个 container 里的路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}points to /secrets, a path inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:37.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个文件系统，一个目录，而这个变量只有在挂载之后才有意义\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two filesystems, one folder, and that variable only makes sense after the mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:40.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载器的 compose 文件搭了同一个传送门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loader's compose file builds the same portal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:44.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从自己的目录出发：往上两级，同一个 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from its own folder: up two levels, same secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:49.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上的那一页只往上爬一级，因为它的 repo 浅一层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's slide climbs only once, because its repos sit one level shallower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,永远要数清往上爬了几级，从脚本所在的位置数起\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Always count the climbs from where the script sits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:55.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的 clone 旁边建好这个目录，这是额外步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Make the folder beside your clone, as an extra,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:06:00.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后把下载的文件移进去，改名为 llm-service-account.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then move the download in and rename it llm-service-account.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:05.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查一下名字：隐藏的扩展名可能让它变成 .json.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check that name: hidden extensions can leave .json.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:08.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外用 tree 看一下，是 README 里的目录结构\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra tree view shows the README's layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把你的也摆成这样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and match it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是一个不显眼的陷阱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now a quiet trap:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:21.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 的 .gitignore 里没有任何关于 secrets 的规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the repo's gitignore has no rule for secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:24.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有任何东西保护放在 repo 里面的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing protects a key inside the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:31.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,假设你把密钥存在 repo 里面，也就是 cheese-app-v0/secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Suppose you save the key inside the repo, in cheese-app-v0/secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:34.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 api-service 里运行 API 脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and run the API script from api-service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:39.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时 /secrets 里有什么，第一次 embedding 调用又会怎样？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What is in /secrets, and what happens on the first embedding call?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:52.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路径还是往上爬两级，爬到一个不存在的目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cursor still climbs twice, to a folder that does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:56.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 不会抱怨；它会悄悄地创建这个目录，空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker does not complain; it silently creates that folder, empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:07:01.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 /secrets 是空的，第一次 embedding 调用会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So /secrets is empty, and the first embedding call fails
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:04.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报 DefaultCredentialsError：找不到文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a DefaultCredentialsError: file not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:08.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而你的密钥正躺在一个没有任何保护的 git 目录树里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Meanwhile your key sits in a git tree that nothing protects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一个前置条件：Docker 网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last prerequisite: the Docker network.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:17.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的命令先悄悄检查它，只有检查失败才创建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's command inspects it quietly, and creates it only if that fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:18.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外再跑一次会怎样？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What happens if you run it again, as an extra?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:24.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不会发生：不报错，也不会多出第二个网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing: no error, no second network.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:28.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条跑两次也安全的命令，叫作幂等的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A command that is safe to run twice is called idempotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:30.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记住这个套路\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember this shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:34.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 llm-rag 里，shell 脚本自带一个默认项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In llm-rag, the shell script ships with a default project
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:35.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而那不是你的项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that is not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:39.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 GCP project 这个变量改成你自己的项目 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Update the GCP_PROJECT variable to your own project ID;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:42.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们用 sed，你用任何编辑器都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we use the sed tool, you use any editor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:44.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，改好它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and edit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:48.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 README 的命令：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the README's command: sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:51.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Compose 拉取 Chroma\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compose pulls Chroma,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:56.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建一个叫 llm-rag-network 的网络，然后在上面启动数据库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}creates a network called llm-rag-network, and starts the database on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:59.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个文件里的每个服务都会自动加入它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every service in this file joins it automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:03.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那行 pull access denied 是无害的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The line that says pull access denied is harmless:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:07.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 image 不在 Docker Hub 上，所以 Compose 在本地构建它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that image is not on Docker Hub, so Compose builds it locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 container 的架构是 x86\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The container's architecture is x86 here;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:13.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Apple Silicon 上会显示 aarch64\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Apple Silicon says aarch64.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:15.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在里面做两个额外检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extra checks inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:19.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥文件出现在 /secrets 里，是穿过传送门来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The key file shows up in /secrets, through the portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:24.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个变量也都设好了，是 Compose 从启动它的脚本那里复制过来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And both variables are set, copied by Compose from the launching script,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:26.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以永远要从这个脚本启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which is why you always start there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关于这次录制，如实说一句\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest note about this recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台机器没有 Google 账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This machine has no Google account.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:35.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你刚才看到的密钥文件，是一个明显无效的替身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The key file you just saw is an obviously invalid stand-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:41.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放它是为了让目录列表和 README 对得上，云端步骤之前就删掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is there so the folder listings match the README, and it was removed before the cloud steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:44.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以从这里开始，每个云端调用的失败方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So from here on, every cloud call fails exactly the way a missing key fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,都和缺少密钥时一模一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So from here on, every cloud call fails exactly the way a missing key fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:50.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是这一讲最常见的错误，所以一眼就要认出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is the most common mistake in this lecture, so learn it on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:55.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你接下来该看到的每一个成功结果，都标着 recorded，并注明出处\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every success you should expect is tagged recorded, with its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:09:00.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进了 container，README 的第一条命令做三件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside the container, the README's first command does three jobs:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.47,0:09:03.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 char-split 分块、向量化、加载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it chunks, embeds and loads, with char-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示符里的 ID 每次运行都会变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The ID in the prompt changes every run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:11.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,分块是真的跑了：11 本书，Tolminc 那本书切成了 24 个 chunk\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Chunking runs for real: 11 books, and the Tolminc book becomes 24 chunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看一个金色标签\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gold tag first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:17.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,向量化这一步会把每个 chunk 发给 Google 的 embedding 模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The embed step sends every chunk to Google's embedding model,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:22.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两次运行加起来大约 700 万个字符，这是我们的估算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}about 7 million characters across both runs, by our estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:25.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这会向你的项目计费；请查看当前的价目页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That bills your project; check the current pricing page.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:29.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,向量化这一步在构建名为 Authorization 的请求头时停了下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The embed step stops while building the header named Authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,别看它叫这个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Despite the name,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它装的其实是你的身份证明，也就是一个 bearer token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it carries proof of who you are, a bearer token,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而这需要密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which needs a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:38.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,DefaultCredentialsError：找不到密钥文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}DefaultCredentialsError: the key file was not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:43.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥就没有令牌：第一个云端请求死在了身份验证这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No key, no token: the first cloud request dies at authentication.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一段就来搭这条链\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next scene builds that chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有真实密钥的话，运行会继续\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a real key, the run continues:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:53.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,向量化每一本书，创建 char-split-collection，最后完成插入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it embeds every book, creates the char-split-collection, and finishes inserting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:57.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍；用你的密钥，这要花一阵子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it; with your key, it takes a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:04.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你看到的是 403，说 API 没有启用，就启用 Vertex AI API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If instead you see a 403 saying the API is disabled, enable the Vertex AI API;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:07.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,讲 IAM 的那一段会给出命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the IAM scene shows the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:10.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二条命令用 recursive-split 做同样的事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second command does the same with recursive-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:13.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍，然后输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it, then type exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:18.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外数一下：char-split 有 8248 个 chunk\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra count shows 8,248 chunks for char-split
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:24.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,recursive-split 有 14228 个，这是录制时的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and 14,228 for recursive-split, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:26.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,递归切分产生的 chunk 更多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Recursive split makes more chunks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:30.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,主要是因为默认最多 200 个字符的重叠\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}mostly from a default overlap of up to 200 characters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:33.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且它在段落和单词之间的断点处切\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it cuts at paragraph and word breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些 chunk 文件通过 /app 这个挂载落到你的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The chunk files land on your laptop through the app mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:38.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里有一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One small slip shows here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:42.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,书名在第一个点处被截断了，所以它的 chunk 没有作者\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A book title is cut at its first dot, so its chunks get no author,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:45.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 的作者过滤永远找不到它们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the agent's author filter never finds them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修法是一个 Python 函数：splitext\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is a Python function, splitext.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:51.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，看一个真实的 Tolminc chunk\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, one real Tolminc chunk:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是对话交给 Gemini 的那种段落\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the kind of passage the chat hands to Gemini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:11:00.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说 ChromaDB 在你退出之后还会继续跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says ChromaDB keeps running after you exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:03.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 docker ps 就能确认，就在 port 8000 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and an extra docker ps confirms it, on port 8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:10.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再额外 curl 一下它的版本：录制时是 1.0.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra curl asks for its version: 1.0.0, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关掉它放在最后\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stopping it comes at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，到底是什么失败了？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So what failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:19.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加载器的 Google 客户端和 API 的一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loader's Google client, like the API's,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:23.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只用一个项目和一个区域来构建，别的什么都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is built from a project and a location, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:26.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 里没有代码去打开密钥文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No code in this repo opens the key file;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:33.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开它的是一个库，靠的是一个叫应用默认凭据的约定，简称 ADC\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a library does, by a convention called application default credentials, or ADC.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:35.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,ADC 按顺序看三个位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ADC looks in three places, in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:40.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，Google application credentials 这个变量指定的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, the file named by the GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS variable:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个服务账号密钥，就像这个教程里的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a service account key, as in this tutorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:48.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二，gcloud 工具为你本人写的一个登录文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Second, a login file the gcloud tool writes for you, as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:53.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三，元数据服务器，在你的代码跑在 Google 的云里时才有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Third, the metadata server, when your code runs inside Google's cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:58.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,ADC 转到下一个位置，只有一种情况：前一个没有设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ADC moves to the next place only when the one before is not set.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:02.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这些 container 里，只有第一个位置存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside these containers, only the first place exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:06.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个库写一张小纸条，也就是一个 JSON Web Token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The library writes a small note, a JSON Web Token, and signs it with your private key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你的私钥签名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The library writes a small note, a JSON Web Token, and signs it with your private key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:11.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把这张纸条送到 Google 的令牌柜台\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It sends that note to Google's token desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,地址就写在你的密钥文件里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the address in your key file.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:15.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 手里有配对的公钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google holds the matching public key,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:19.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以不用看到私钥，就能验证你的签名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it checks your signature without ever seeing the private one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:22.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换回来的是一个访问令牌，有效期大约一小时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back comes an access token, valid for about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:26.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个令牌跟着每个请求走，作为 bearer 请求头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That token rides on every request as a bearer header.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:31.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的私钥从不离开你的电脑；在路上跑的只有那张短期有效的票\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your private key never leaves your machine; only the short-lived ticket travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一小时用完，库会再换一个新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When the hour runs out, the library gets a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:38.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上那张 OAuth 图也终止在同一个柜台\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's OAuth diagram ends at this same desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:41.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只是少了授权同意页面：这里没有人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}minus the consent screen: no person is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来看 ADC 被抓个现行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is ADC caught in the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:46.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 /secrets 为空的情况下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With /secrets empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:50.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外用一行 Python 检查问 ADC 我们是谁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra one-line Python check asks ADC who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:53.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,变量设了，所以 ADC 打开那个路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The variable is set, so ADC opens that path,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:57.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,找不到文件，就停在那里，报同一个错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}finds no file, and stops right there, with the same error.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:01.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,错误的路径永远不会退回到另外两个位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A wrong path never falls back to the other two places.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:05.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥放好了，它就会说出你的服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key in place, it names your service account instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:08.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个常见的误解：在你的 Mac 上设这个变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One common mix-up: setting that variable on your Mac
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:13.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对 container 里面的身份验证毫无作用，那里这个路径必须存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}authenticates nothing inside a container, where the path must exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:18.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以脚本设的是 container 里的路径，再单独挂载宿主机目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is why the scripts set a container path, and mount the host folder separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:21.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,身份验证证明了你的代码是谁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Authentication proved who your code is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:25.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,授权决定它能做什么，在哪里做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Authorization decides what it may do, and where.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:30.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 把这叫 IAM：一个由身份、角色和资源组成的格子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google calls this IAM: a grid of identities, roles, and resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:34.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的服务账号在你的项目里持有 Gemini 用户这个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your service account holds the Gemini user role in your project,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正起作用的是那个绿色的格子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and that green cell does the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:41.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Storage Admin 在它旁边，授予了，但这个应用从来没用过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Storage Admin sits beside it, granted but never used by this app.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个请求检验三个格子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three requests test three cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:46.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,IAM 检查的是请求里点名的资源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}IAM checks the resource the request names;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对 embedding 来说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for an embedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:51.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个名字是客户端根据你的 GCP project 这个变量写出来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the client writes that name from your project variable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:54.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你自己项目里的 embedding 是允许的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An embedding in your own project is allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:58.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同样的调用换成脚本里没改过的默认项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The same call with the script's unedited default project
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:02.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,会以 403 被拒绝，因为你的账号在那里没有角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is refused with a 403, because your account has no role there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以两个脚本都要改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is why you edit both scripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三根箭头留到第二部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The third arrow waits for part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,DefaultCredentialsError 或者 401\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A DefaultCredentialsError, or a 401,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:14.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,意思是没有有效的令牌：检查路径、挂载和文件名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}means no valid token: check the path, the mount, and the file name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:19.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,403 的意思是身份验证通过了，但授权失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A 403 means authentication worked, but authorization failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:24.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因：缺了角色、项目不对，或者 API 没有启用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cause: a missing role, the wrong project, or an API that is not enabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:27.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后这个原因是一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That last cause is a small gap:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:31.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里没有哪个 README 说要启用 Vertex AI API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no README here says to enable the Vertex AI API.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:34.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你从没启用过，403 会直接说出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you never did, the 403 says so,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:37.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条额外的 gcloud 命令就能修好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and one extra gcloud command fixes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:39.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:41.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的密钥用来做 embedding 没问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your key works for embeddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:43.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在你贴上授课老师的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now you paste the instructor's endpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:46.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它以 projects 和一长串数字开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which begins with projects and a long number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:49.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一部分决定检查谁的 IAM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which part decides whose IAM is checked:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:54.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GCP project 这个变量、密钥里的项目，还是 endpoint 路径？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the project variable, the project inside your key, or the endpoint path?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:08.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是路径。不是密钥里的项目：那只说明工牌是在哪儿签发的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The path. Not the key's project: that only says where the badge was issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:09.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也不是那个变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not the variable:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:13.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,endpoint 路径本身已经点名了一个项目，以这个名字为准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the endpoint path already names a project, and that name wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:19.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那是别人的项目，你的账号在那里没有角色，所以是 403\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is someone else's project, where your account has no role, so it is a 403;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分会把它画出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}part 2 draws it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:27.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分的最后一段：API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last stretch of part 1, the API.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:32.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 api-service 目录里，做第二处项目名的修改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the api-service folder, make the second project-name edit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:33.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，照着做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:38.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 README 的命令：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the README's command, sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:43.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它马上就挂了：网络已经存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It dies at once: the network already exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:46.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是这个 repo 里最大的疏漏，不是你的错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is the biggest slip in the repo, and not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:50.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 14 行无条件地创建网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 14 creates the network unconditionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:54.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而第 4 行的 set -e 会让脚本在第一个错误处停下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and set -e, on line 4, stops the script at the first error.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以它一碰到网络已经存在就会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So it fails whenever the network exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪怕刚跑完 README 自己建网络的那一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}even right after the README's own network step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修法就是前面见过的那个套路\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is the shape you met earlier:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:06.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把第 14 行换成 README 那条先检查、不存在再创建的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}make line 14 the README's inspect-or-create command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:11.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，在你的编辑器里改好；sed 是我们的做法，算额外步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and make that edit in your editor; the sed is ours, an extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run the script again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:17.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次构建会从 Pipfile.lock 安装 170 个 pin 住的包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first build installs 170 pinned packages from Pipfile.lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:21.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这在录制时花了大约三分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which took about three minutes at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会进到 pipenv shell 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You land in the pipenv shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.93,0:16:26.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 uvicorn server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type uvicorn_server,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:32.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 就在 port 9000 上启动，监听 0.0.0.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the API starts on port 9000, listening on 0.0.0.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:34.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:40.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器在 secrets 目录为空的情况下也顺利启动了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server started cleanly with an empty secrets folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:45.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 Google 客户端要到第一个请求时才去找凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the Google client does not look for credentials until its first request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第二个终端里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a second terminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:50.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外用 curl 请求一个 embedding，得到的是 500\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra curl asks for an embedding and gets a 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:54.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器日志里是同一个 DefaultCredentialsError\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server log shows the same DefaultCredentialsError,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:56.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在构建 bearer 请求头时抛出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}raised while building the bearer header.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:17:00.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,启动是绿的，不代表身份验证过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A green startup is not an authenticated startup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:05.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有真实密钥的话，同样的请求会返回一个 256 个数的列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a real key, the same request returns a list of 256 numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是 embedding\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the embedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:11.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个长度必须和加载器的一致，否则数据库查询会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That length must match the loader's, or the database queries fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:14.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整条链也会一路亮起来，一直到 200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the whole chain lights up, through to a 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 在这里的最后一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's last step here:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:20.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在浏览器里打开 localhost:9000/docs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}open localhost:9000/docs in your browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，看一看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:25.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑几次 curl，能看到文档页和 README 里的五个路由\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extra curls show the docs page and the README's five routes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:27.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,外加根路径上的一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus one more at the root.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:32.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的机器上，有真实密钥的话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On your machine, with a real key,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:37.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,身份验证的链条现在就完整了，API 在你的笔记本上应答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the auth chain is now complete, and the API answers on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:38.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,让它一直跑着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Leave it running.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分问两个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 asks two questions:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:44.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,网页怎么找到这个 API，还有谁也能找到它？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}how does a web page find this API, and who else can?
